        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shitambo h'ipandī līmò dūhū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A malange aya nī shilagīlo īshi, shidimagi mu welwa ng'holò; mushishikīlīje pyī ū mu shikū ja būlamu wing'we, ū ng'wikanza lya kwikala kwing'we ū mu sī īyo alīng'winha ū SEEBA Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shiigelile mugakenaagūle pye gete a mapandī ga kūlamīja, ayo banhū ba mahanga abo mulīja kūbataaja sī yabo bakagatūmamīlaga kūbalamya bamulungu babo. A mapandī genayo galī mu ngūlū na mu sī ja magūlya, gangī galī mu mbeho ja mitī mitaale ya madūūtū madoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī myalīlo yabo īsambaagūlagi gete, hama balī na mawe bakagalamyaga; nago gabelagūlagi. Na ng'hīngī ja Maashela balī najo, nī jene jipembagi mu moto, na a mashiikolile ga bamulungu babo gakambagūlagi, mugakenaagūle gete a mina gabo gīnge ū mu mapandī genayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we yaya ū kūnamya gīko ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo mukūlīkooba ī lipandī īlo SEEBA Mulungu wing'we alalīsole kūfuma ū mu ng'anda jing'we ī jose, kūbiza wikalo wakwe na kūtūūla ho lina lakwe. Ū kwipandī lyenīlo h'ūko mukūyūja; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "h'ūko mukūyūtwala nī shakwinha shing'we sha kūpemva mu moto, pyī nī shitambò shing'we. Nī zaka jing'we enhagi kwenūko, nī shakwinha shing'we īsho mushitūūlile kūlwa kūmfunīja SEEBA, nī shakwinha shing'we sha kūlahīla, nī sha wiyaabī, pye na a matwajo ging'we ga kwandya; nī shakwinha sha kūfuma mu madaale ging'we ga ng'ombe na ga ng'holo na mbūli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kwipandī lyenīlo h'ūko mukūyūlya na kūyega kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, a bing'we nī kaya jing'we. Shiyegelagi pyī īsho SEEBA Mulungu wing'we akūng'wīlūkīla kūshīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kwīta gīt'ūmo tūkwītīlaga kūūnū ī lelo, ūmo būlī ng'wene akwītīlaga gīt'ūmo atogelilwe wei ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno mutaalī ū kūshika ū kwipandī ī lya kwifuula na lya wingīji wing'we, īlo SEEBA Mulungu wing'we alīng'winha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū mulagūkīle ū mongo gwa Yolodani muje mukikale ū mu sī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wing'we alīng'winha kūbiza wingīji wing'we; akūng'wifuuja ū kū mahanga a gose ayo gakūbiza gamupīndije, galeke ū kūmukoya ng'wikale mu mhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū kwipandī īlo SEEBA Mulungu wing'we akūlīsola kūlwa kwikala lina lyakwe, ū kwenūko h'ūko mukūyūshenha pyī ī shikolo īsho nalīmukomeleja; ī shakwinha shing'we sha kūpemva mu moto, nī shitambò shing'we; nī zaka jing'we, nī shakwinha shing'we īsho mushitūūlile kūlwa kūmfunīja SEEBA, nī shingī pyī ī shawiza īsho mukūyūlahīla kūmfunīja we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū kwipandī lyenīlo h'ūko mukūnyegela ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we; a bing'we na a bitūnja bing'we na abashīke bing'we, na a basese bing'we bagosha na bakīma, hamò na a Balawī abo balī ū mu mizengo ying'we, abo batī na ngabo nūūlū wingīji wabo boi benekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilang'hanage ūtizūfunya shitambò shako sha kūpemva mu moto kwipandī lyose lyose īlo bebe ng'wenekīlī ūtogwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shitambò shako shifunyage ū kwipandī īlo SEEBA Mulungu wako alakūsolele kūfuma ū mu lūganda lwa ng'wing'we; h'ūko ūkwīyītīla pyī īyo nalīkūlagīla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Īsho shidūgije kūlīīlwa kūngī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a hene ūdūgije kūgūsīnzīla ū ntugo gwako nūūlū ūlī aho ūzengile, ūlya ī nyama gīt'ūmo ūtogelilwe; ūmo mukalīīlaga sūbūya nūūlū mhala, gīt'ūmo SEEBA Mulungu wako alakwīlūkīle mbango. Pye a banhū, a beela na a babo batī beela, bazunīlījiwe ū kwīlya ī nyama yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a mininga a gene yaya gete ū kūgalya; shiigelile ūgiite hasī gītī minzī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī zaka ya shakwinha shako sha būsu nī ya divai, nī ya maguta, yaya ū kwīlīīla ū mu nzengo ūyo ūkwikalaga; pyī nī mbyalwa ja kwandya ja mu madaale gako ga ng'ombe na ga ng'holo na mbūli. Nūūlū shose shose īsho wilahīla kūshifunya kūbiza shakwinha, nī shakwinha sha wiyaabī, nūūlū īsho mushitūūlile kūlwa kūmfunīja SEEBA, nūūlū shakwinha shingī īsho mulīshifunya kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shose shenīshi ūkūshilya ūlī kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako, kwipandī īlo alalīsole ū SEEBA Mulungu wako. Ūkūshilya ū bebe nū ng'witūnja wako nū nshīke wako, nū nsese wako ngosha na nkīma, hamò na a Balawī abo balī ū mu mizengo ying'we. Ūkūyega kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako, ūshilūmbe pyī īsho akūkwīlūkīlaga kūshīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilang'hanage ūtizūbīība a Balawī ū mu būlamu wako ū bose ū mu sī yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ūlū wīgalīhya ī sī yako gīt'ūmo wakwisagīgīja, hūna ū bebe wandya kwikūmva nyama ūhaya, “Nakūmbūlaga kūlya nyama;” ūdūgije kūlya ī nyama gīt'ūmo ūtogelilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lipandī īlo SEEBA Mulungu wako akūlīsola kūlwa kūtūūla mo lina lyakwe ūlū lyūbiza līlīkūle ū kūfuma a ha ng'wako, ūdūgije kūsīnza ntugo gwa ng'widaale lyako lya ng'ombe nūūlū lya ng'holo na mbūli, ūmo SEEBA alakwinhīle; hūna wīta ūmo nalīkūlagīīlīla, ī nyama wīlīīla mu nzengo gwako gīt'ūmo ūlatogelwe bebe ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyaga gīt'ūmo ūkalīīlaga sūbūya nūūlū mhala; nīyo pye a banhū, a beela na a babo batī beela, bazunīlījiwe ū kwīlya ī nyama yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ilang'hanage, yaya ū kūgalya a mininga gayo; nguno a mininga hū ū būpanga, na lūūlū ilang'hanage ūtizūbūlīīlanīja mu nyama ū būpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūgalya a mininga nūūlū hado, gitage hasī gītī minzī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtizūgima gete ū kūgalya, ī mihayo īkūjīle chiza ū bebe ng'wenekīlī na a baana bako a hanuma yako; nguno ū mu gīko ūkūbiza ūlīīta ītūngīlīgije ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī shikolo shako ī sheela, nī shisho walahīla gīkī ūkūshifunya shibize shakwinha, ī shenīsho shisolage ūje nasho ū kwipandī īlo SEEBA alalīsole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakwinha shako sha kūpemva mu moto shifunyage ha ng'walīlo go ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako; ī nyama ī yose na a mininga. A mininga ga shitambò shako shiigelile giitwe hasī haho nū ng'walīlo go ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako, ī nyama ī yene ūdūgije kwīlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ilang'hanage wīshikīlīje pyī īyo nalīkūlagīla yenīyī, īje chiza ī mihayo yako būl'ikanza; ū bebe na a baana bako abo bakūbyalwa hanuma yako. Nguno ūlū wīta gīko ūkūbiza ūlīīta ītūngīlīgije ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūhūgūlwa kūlwa kūlamya shiikolile",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akūgakenaagūla a mahanga gakwīngīle, ayo sī yago ūlīja kwīdima ībize yako. Alīyo ū bebe ūlū ūmala ū kūgapeeja a mahanga genayo, hūna ūkwikala ū mu sī yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama a banhū benabo ūlū būshila, ilang'hanage lūūlū ū bebe, ūtizūgwa mu nhūngwa ja kūbūūgīlīja mihayo ya bamulungu babo, ūkūhayaga; “Ī gete a banhū ba mahanga genaya baabatūmamīlaga kinehe a bamulungu babo? Nane nageme wa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū bebe ū kūnamya gīko ū SEEBA Mulungu wako; nguno a boi ū mu kūbalamya a bamulungu babo, bakīītaga mihayo ya malofu ya būlī mbika, īyo ayīkolilwe ū SEEBA; bakabapembaga na mu moto bitūnja na bashīke babo, kūlwa kūbafunya shitambò kū bamulungu babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū, yītage pyī īyo nalīkūlagīla; yaya ū kongeleleja ho, nūūlū kwīnja ho shose shose yaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
